            "title": "EMDR Basic Training",
            "content": "<p>12-week EMDR Basic Training course for licensed clinicians and advanced graduate students integrating Eye Movement Desensitization and Reprocessing into clinical practice. The curriculum follows the standardized EMDRIA model and covers the eight phases of EMDR, the adaptive information processing framework, and the clinical skills required to safely and effectively treat trauma using EMDR therapy.</p><p>This program is currently undergoing EMDRIA review. Registration will open to waitlist members first once approval is granted. Join the waitlist to be notified the moment enrollment becomes available.</p>",
